  "description": "Watch now | How to Navigate StockTok, Everything Linked in One place",
  "body_html": "<p><span>🧑🏼‍🏫 </span><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a></strong><span> - Never invested before? No problem. All of my education is free. I made 10 short videos to get literally anyone up and going into their first trade.</span></p><p><span>🌟</span><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary Page</a></strong><span> - The most important feature of StockTok, the summary page lists </span><em><strong>my positions</strong></em><span> and the </span><em><strong>StockTok Screened</strong></em><span> stocks. This page is updated once a day so you can see past and present performance, along with stocks that are having pivot breakouts with volume.</span></p><p><span>🗣 </span><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Main Cha</a></strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">t</a><span> - This is where I hangout </span><em><strong>during market hours</strong></em><span>. </span><strong><span>Do not feel compelled to always be in the chat, I will never post a stock pick in there</span></strong><span>. This is just a place to chat, share ideas and sometimes we just joke around. We have some other really good traders, and people, in there.</span></p><p><span>🌱 </span><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a><span> </span></strong><span>- Many people have been interested in this, so including. This is a basket of stocks I put together for 2026. As long as you see this post, it is still relevant. These stocks are for the long haul and evaluated on the monthly timeframe, more suited for longer term investors, that want to ignore the news. This is updated near the beginning of the month.</span></p><p><span>⚡</span><strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a></strong><span> - When I make a video or write an article, it takes time. A post can take me anywhere from 1 hour to 2 days, depending on the topic and complexity. Quick notes is where I put the main idea and/or stock pick that I am going to post next. Please note, </span><em><strong>I do not day trade</strong></em><span>, so do not expect constant signals there. Its just the 1st place I put an idea or pick.</span></p><h4><strong>All of MY stock picks will always come out in a post, at the top of my page and your e-mail!</strong></h4><div><hr></div><p><span>There are many different kinds of charting software out there. To be abundantly clear: You should NOT be spending much, if any money on them! In fact, I most often operate with “naked” charts…literally nothing on them. I see people with a gazillion indicators on….and they suck! Price action is king, not some indicator. I personally use </span><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/\">TradingView</a><span>; mostly because I have used it forever, and can connect my brokerage easily to the platform.</span></p><p>If you also use TradingView, feel free to utilize any of the personally built indicators below. Click the link, then select “add to favorites” and it will be in your indicators list.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><span>📈 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/script/YkJaCmZq-StockTok-Trend-Indicator/\">Timothy’s Trend Indicator</a></strong><span> - This tool just identifies potential new trends. How is a new trend formed? when the prior trend is broken…go from making new lows, to new highs, preferably with volume. Pretty simple.</span></p><p><strong><span>🚀 </span><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/v/D62aWpQ5/\">Timothy’s Pump Machine</a></strong><span> - This tool is a combination of Mark Minervini rules and my own smoothing with Heikin Ashi Candles. It identifies what stocks are having the most momentum by comparing price action strength relative to the S&amp;P 500. </span><em><strong>You want to target the 1st or 2nd signal</strong></em><span>…if you see a dozen signals on your chart, it may be too far gone at that point and you are guessing where a top is at.</span></p><p><strong><span>🖩 </span><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/script/G4JKzejz-StockTok-Portfolio-Risk-Assessment/\">Portfolio Risk Calculator</a><span> </span></strong><span>- Say you have $25,000 in your portfolio. You like a stock. You want to put $5,000 into that stock. Now you have to decide how much risk you want to take on. A -25% stop loss would be a -5% loss to your total portfolio…THATS TOO MUCH (in my opinion). A -5% stop loss would equate to a -1% risk to your total portfolio, that is far more reasonable. My personal rule is to never risk more than 3% of your portfolio equity. This tool just tells you if your position is too heavy, or if you stop is too wide. Click the “settings” cog ⚙️ on the indicator, input your portfolio value, the position size you want, and how much of a stop you want (ie. -5%). It will tell you if a position is good, moderate risk, or too risky.</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png\" width=\"948\" height=\"369\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:369,&quot;width&quot;:948,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:115272,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/181712555?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XCTK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff379acd3-47b0-4d3d-bd18-c8e9abffb519_948x369.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Click on “Add to favorites”</figcaption></figure></div><p><span>🎢 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/v/CdLszxkv/\">Market Cap Move Estimator</a></strong><span> - A penny stock will, often, have far greater movements than say a blue chip stock. So obviously, you are not going to trade them the same. Your stops and position sizing will vary significantly. To help you determine the volatility of a stock, the market cap move estimator will plot on your chart an “average” day for the stock and a “big move” day for the stock. You can measure the distance with the % ruler, to help you decide how wide of a stop you may want. I never use this as an indicator, but if I did, I would want price tapping the “big move up” line.</span></p><p>If you need help setting up any of these, again, just ask in the Main Chat!</p><p>The only other 2 things I check on a regular basis:</p><p><span>🔮 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html\">FedWatch</a><span> </span></strong><span>- This forecasts the interest rate chances for the next FOMC. I care about what the forecasts are 4 to 6 months in advance…never the very next FOMC, because those rates are already priced into the market!</span></p><p><span>📊 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/market-data/stocks/newfiftytwoweekhighsandlows?gaa_at=eafs&amp;gaa_n=AWEtsqehcKkNEX8n21tSNXD6Domox44O5tiz1OJsv5CMSSVj4GJSzwIeH1dQxb0E4oQ%3D&amp;gaa_ts=69406625&amp;gaa_sig=fpVikDfy8c4z2DpXYdCPdpYqPzvpKjjiCI9_hG1I8vNM4Ww-vNfEKmV2LEqajx0xoqQ3EGpkaZKOG0loZ7M_8A%3D%3D\">New 52 Week Highs &amp; Lows</a><span> </span></strong><span>- The only thing I care about here, is that we are seeing more stocks make new highs, than new stocks making lows. This is a key indicator for me to determine if odds are in our favor of a trending market.</span></p><p><span>Help yourself to any of the tools above. Please note, there is not a single indicator on this planet that bats 100%…my tools are built to help you (and me)…not be a crutch. You must still have a strategy. </span></p><p><em><strong>Hope this helps you. Don’t be shy about questions. The only dumb question is the one not asked. </strong></em></p><p>Thanks for stopping by!  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
